%% mermaid-svg-bitbucket: how a fenced block becomes a committed SVG, and what each gate can and cannot see.
%% --
%% Drawn because nothing diagrammed this skill and the two halves of it failed in
%% opposite directions: the RENDER path checked the artifact and refused to write a
%% bad one, while the --check path never opened the artifact at all.
%% THAT SECOND HALF IS NOW FIXED, and this diagram is kept rather than rewritten
%% clean because the defect it was drawn to expose is what got it fixed.
%% --
